flowchart TD
  A[test: api / apiAs / apiInCase / apiAsNewUser] --> B[runInContext via AsyncLocalStorage]
  B --> C[real src api fn: cases, collections, dashboards, systemDashboards]
  C --> D[playwright-adapter: getContext from ALS]
  D --> E[ctx.fetch url, method, headers, body, params]
  E --> F{status 401?}
